    {
      "id": "p0069-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "8-4's first challenge was to get the English version of Undertale running on Sony's PlayStation 4 and Vita systems. Toby had originally developed Undertale with home computers in mind, so getting the game to run smoothly on these cutting-edge gaming systems took months of work between multiple parties.",
        "raw": "8-4's first challenge was to get the English version of Underta/e running on\nSony's PlayStation 4 and Vita systems. Toby had originally developed Underta/e\nwith home computers in mind, so getting the game to run smoothly on these\ncutting-edge gaming systems took months of work between multiple parties.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09814039,
          0.13656429,
          0.70531691,
          0.20472143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09605144,
          0.13585,
          0.70897765,
          0.20579286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "8-4 的第一个难题，是让英语版 Undertale 在索尼的 PlayStation 4 和 Vita 上运行。Toby 原本只考虑个人电脑，因此要让游戏在这些先进主机上流畅运行，需要多方合作数月。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
