    {
      "id": "p0069-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "8-4's progTammer faced other technical challenges too. The game had to be reprogrammed to work with the new Japanese text. Further work was needed to allow the English and Japanese data to coexist inside the same game. And, of course, all of these changes resulted in countless new bugs that needed to be found and squashed.",
        "raw": "8-4's progTammer faced other technical challenges too. The game had to be\nreprogrammed to work with the new Japanese text. Further work was needed\nto allow the English and Japanese data to coexist inside the same game. And, of\ncourse, all of these changes resulted in countless new bugs that needed to be\nfound and squashed.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09831278,
          0.40268571,
          0.70692926,
          0.4887
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
